  "_readme": "Which boards (the fields picked in onboarding) poll which sources. A source's folder decides the boards allowed to poll it: finance/ only Finance, tech/ only the tech boards and Healthcare, shared/ all of them, health/ only Healthcare. A board polls only the groups it names, so adding a board to a folder's audience changes no other board. The Finance board polls every finance/ and shared/ pack: every source it polled in 0.3.7, settings unchanged, plus the shared/ employers whose feeds also carry finance roles (a finance firm's tech feed, a tech firm's whole feed); an employer with no finance roles goes in tech/. The finance firms' shared groups sit in the tech filters beside bank_technology. Every other board names the pack groups (file names) it polls: core always, plus the groups of the filters picked (Software, Backend), or of every filter when none is picked. 'everything' polls every pack. A source in no pack (one the user added) is always polled.",
